			<name>Bite</name>
			<description>This is a primary attack that deals the indicated damage plus 1-1/2 times the dragon's Strength bonus (even though it has more than one attack). A dragon's bite attack has reach as if the creature were one size category larger (+10 feet for Colossal dragons).</description>
			<type>RACEABILITY.SPECIALQUALITY</type>
