			<source>Paizo Inc. - </source>
		</special_quality>
			<name>Luck (Sp)</name>
			<description>Once per day an adult or older gold dragon can touch a gem, usually one embedded in the dragon's hide, and enspell it to bring good luck. As long as the dragon carries the gem, it and every good creature within a given radius of it (120 ft.) receives a +1 luck bonus on all saving throws. If the dragon gives an enspelled gem to another creature, only that bearer gets the bonus. The effect lasts 1d3+12 hours. This ability is the equivalent of a 2nd-level spell.</description>
			<type>SPECIALQUALITY.SPELLLIKE.AURA</type>
			<associated></associated>
