			<source>Paizo Inc. - </source>
		</special_quality>
			<name>Tail Sweep (Ex)</name>
			<description>This allows a Gargantuan or larger dragon to sweep with its tail as a standard action. The sweep affects a half-circle with a radius of 30 feet (or 40 feet for a Colossal dragon), extending from an intersection on the edge of the dragon's space in any direction. Creatures within the swept area are affected if they are four or more size categories smaller than the dragon. A tail sweep automatically deals 2d8+24. Affected creatures can attempt Reflex saves to take half damage (DC 34).</description>
			<type>RACEABILITY.SPECIALATTACK.EXTRAORDINARY</type>
